08009E98 collision-slot-init-return

Effect_SetOrigin performs two byte stores using r0 as their base. The following
store in StrikeTrap_InitSlot uses r1, preserving the sprite pointer.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/objects/strike_traps.c
+++ b/src/objects/strike_traps.c
@@ -68,4 +68,7 @@
     Effect_SetOrigin(sprite, -8, -8);
     slot->active = 1;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (s32)sprite; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
